  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "The bar graph shows the results of a survey on color preferences. From left to right, the bars represent red, blue, brown, pink, and green. What percent preferred blue?",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(20\\%\\)"
